# scripts/officer-test-fixture.mjs line 34.
#
# ITS HISTORY IS DELIBERATELY NOT REWRITTEN. A committed credential is burned, and
# the answer to a burned credential is rotation, not concealment: rewriting history
# would destroy the evidence and still leave anyone who had already cloned the
# repository holding a working password. The rotation is that no reusable password
# exists any more. The value in that commit opens nothing. Accounted for, not
# silenced.
#
